  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44115616",
      "title": "Making Sense of Component Host Elements",
      "lectureOrder": 113,
      "videoOrder": 107,
      "sourceHash": "14a6a3a1ccb93c9113c560fdf77e83f149f3d08baf3e7342e77b2f0fb4a04667",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.63,
          "end": 3.06,
          "en": "So we did now fix the styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.06,
          "end": 5.04,
          "en": "of the control component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.04,
          "end": 8.433,
          "en": "They're also broken for the buttons, though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.63,
          "end": 13.86,
          "en": "And the styles are broken here, or the button is un-styled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.86,
          "end": 16.86,
          "en": "because in the button component CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.86,
          "end": 19.71,
          "en": "I'm looking for button elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.71,
          "end": 22.14,
          "en": "but we have no button elements in the button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.14,
          "end": 23.61,
          "en": "component template file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.61,
          "end": 25.203,
          "en": "We only have spans in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.1,
          "end": 28.92,
          "en": "Now, of course, we could wrap it all with a button and so on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.92,
          "end": 32.22,
          "en": "and use appButton as a element selector instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.22,
          "end": 33.81,
          "en": "of these selectors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.81,
          "end": 36.39,
          "en": "But I'm not doing this here for a purpose,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.39,
          "end": 38.34,
          "en": "as I explained before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.34,
          "end": 42.24,
          "en": "because it is not uncommon that you sometimes want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.24,
          "end": 44.85,
          "en": "to extend some built-in element, like a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.85,
          "end": 48.72,
          "en": "and just override its styles and maybe its template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.72,
          "end": 50.46,
          "en": "or extend its template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.46,
          "end": 52.503,
          "en": "So I wanna keep that the way it is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54,
          "end": 58.83,
          "en": "But what we can do instead is target the host element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.83,
          "end": 60.96,
          "en": "of our component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.96,
          "end": 65.49,
          "en": "because every Angular component has a host",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.49,
          "end": 67.83,
          "en": "element, which is simply the element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.83,
          "end": 69.963,
          "en": "that is selected by the selector.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.28999999999999,
          "end": 75.27,
          "en": "So for the control component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.27,
          "end": 79.443,
          "en": "the host element would be this app-control element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.37,
          "end": 84.15,
          "en": "So if you go to our page and we inspect it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.15,
          "end": 88.59,
          "en": "and we select that input, we can see that that input is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.59,
          "end": 89.73,
          "en": "inside of a paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.73,
          "end": 93.69,
          "en": "and that paragraph is inside of that app-control element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.69,
          "end": 98.013,
          "en": "And that would be the host element of our control component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.88,
          "end": 102.53999999999999,
          "en": "For the button component, the host element is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.53999999999999,
          "end": 106.953,
          "en": "therefore the button with the attribute appButton on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.6,
          "end": 112.32,
          "en": "And in your styles, you can target that host element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.32,
          "end": 115.22999999999999,
          "en": "which I do want to target here since I want to style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.22999999999999,
          "end": 119.46000000000001,
          "en": "that button, by using the special :host",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.46000000000001,
          "end": 121.143,
          "en": "CSS selector.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.55,
          "end": 124.92,
          "en": "Now, this is not a CSS course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.92,
          "end": 128.28,
          "en": "so we will rarely work in the CSS files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.28,
          "end": 132.87,
          "en": "but this special host selector is a CSS feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.87,
          "end": 135.87,
          "en": "you should know when working with Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.87,
          "end": 139.71,
          "en": "because it does allow you to directly apply styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.71,
          "end": 142.443,
          "en": "to the rendered host element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 144.57,
          "end": 145.92000000000002,
          "en": "So I'll do that here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.92000000000002,
          "end": 149.71,
          "en": "and replace all my button occurrences with host",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.81,
          "end": 155.7,
          "en": "like this and attached you find the updated button.component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 155.7,
          "end": 158.07,
          "en": "CSS file just to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.07,
          "end": 160.323,
          "en": "that we're all on the same page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 162.96,
          "end": 166.92000000000002,
          "en": "With that, that button looks the way it did before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 166.92000000000002,
          "end": 170.763,
          "en": "but now we're achieving this by targeting the host element.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
